silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_02_preservation_laws_as_transport_correctness_sections_01_identity_preservation_law_concrete_anchor#householdmittensidentity silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdMittensIdentity is the household identity arrow on Mittens (Mittens-is-Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '1_A', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
