silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_02_preservation_laws_as_transport_correctness_sections_01_identity_preservation_law_concrete_anchor#clinicpatientidentity silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicPatientIdentity is the clinic identity arrow on the patient image of Mittens (this-patient-is-this-patient). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '1_{F(A)}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
